# Host crontab reference template for the MinIO backup (S9-X-01-B0).
# This is a HOST cron, NOT a container cron.
#
# Supported install path: infra/scripts/install-minio-backup-cron.sh
#   e.g. infra/scripts/install-minio-backup-cron.sh --dest "$HOME/minio-backups" --mode exec
#
# Destinations:
#   - default: $HOME/minio-backups (works without sudo)
#   - optional: /srv/backups/minio (requires sudo mkdir + chown; see runbook)
#
# MODE=exec is REQUIRED on this host: the `minio/mc` image cannot be pulled
# ("pull access denied"), so the script runs `mc` inside `infra-minio-1`.
# With a mounted destination and the image available, omit MODE (default docker).
#
# Retention is automatic via RETENTION_DAYS (default 14); no manual prune needed.
MAILTO=""
# 17 3 * * * MODE=exec MINIO_BACKUP_DIR=/home/alejobasilesoca/minio-backups /path/to/infra/scripts/minio-backup.sh >> /home/alejobasilesoca/minio-backups/backup.log 2>&1
